  "steps": [
    "Grind the coconut, dried red chillies, coriander seeds, cumin, turmeric, garlic and ginger with a little water to a fine paste.",
    "Heat the oil and sauté the onion until soft and translucent.",
    "Add the ground paste and cook 3 minutes, stirring.",
    "Pour in the water, add the kokum and salt and bring to a gentle boil; simmer for 8 minutes.",
    "Slide in the fish steaks and green chillies and simmer, uncovered, for 8 to 10 minutes until the fish is cooked.",
    "Rest the curry for 15 minutes before serving with rice."
  ]
